const CURRENT_ACCEPTANCE_TEXT='I confirm that I have read and understood this agreement, that the significant matters in it have been explained to me, and that I have had an opportunity to ask questions. I accept the scope of services, professional fees, disbursements, government costs and payment terms, and authorise the licensed immigration adviser named in this agreement, acting through Turner Hopkins Services Limited, to act and represent me in the agreed matters.';
